---
import type { Locale } from '../../i18n';

interface Props { locale: Locale }
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const zh = locale === 'zh';
const t = (cn: string, en: string) => zh ? cn : en;

const navItems = [
  { href: '#protocol', label: t('实验协议', 'Protocol') },
  { href: '#questions', label: t('七个问题', 'Seven questions') },
  { href: '#g2-ablation', label: t('第二代消融', 'G2 ablation') },
  { href: '#next-steps', label: t('下一步', 'Next steps') },
  { href: '#appendix', label: t('附录', 'Appendix') },
] as const;
---

<header class="results-hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">OPENEVO × WEBSHOP · RESEARCH FINDINGS</p>
  <h1>{t('OpenEvo × WebShop 研究结果', 'OpenEvo × WebShop research findings')}</h1>
  <p class="lede">{t(
    '探究 Agent 内生经验转化为通用能力的边界与瓶颈（证据截止：H1.41）。',
    'Where an agent’s endogenous experience turns into reusable capability — and where it breaks. Evidence cutoff: H1.41.',
  )}</p>

  <div class="abstract-box" aria-label={t('摘要', 'Abstract')}>
    <div class="abstract-row">
      <span class="abstract-label established">{t('已确立结论', 'Established')}</span>
      <p>{t(
        '模型自身的成功经验经过一次参数更新，可以在训练未见的任务上带来可复现的收益：H1.38B 首次得到 95% CI 完全位于 0 以上的 fresh-task（新任务）迁移，H1.39 又在 64 个 task-ID-disjoint（任务 ID 不重叠）的全新任务上独立复现，ordinary-LoRA 与 SD-LoRA 两种更新路线都高于同一个 BASE。',
        'One parameter update from the model’s own successful experience produces reproducible benefit on tasks excluded from training: H1.38B gave the first fresh-task transfer whose 95% CI lay entirely above zero, and H1.39 independently replicated it on 64 task-ID-disjoint fresh tasks, with both ordinary-LoRA and SD-LoRA above the same BASE.',
      )}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="abstract-row">
      <span class="abstract-label bottleneck">{t('当前核心瓶颈', 'Current bottleneck')}</span>
      <p>{t(
        '第二次连续写入（G2）没有同时通过新经验获取、旧能力保留与已复现收益保持三道门，多代演化尚未确立；SEED 官方 held-out（goal_idx 0–499）的同台评测尚未执行，formal evaluation denominator（正式评估分母）= 0。',
        'The second continual write (G2) did not simultaneously clear new-experience acquisition, prior-capability retention, and preservation of the replicated gain, so multi-generation evolution is not established; the SEED official held-out evaluation (goal_idx 0–499) has not been executed, and the formal evaluation denominator is 0.',
      )}</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="cutoff-note">
    <strong>{t('证据截止：H1.41', 'Evidence cutoff: H1.41')}</strong>
    <span>{t(
      'H1.42 是之后产生的 measurement-boundary（测量边界）记录：它校准了测量链，但不反过来改变 H1.41 时点已经成立或尚未成立的结论。',
      'H1.42 is a measurement-boundary record produced after H1.41: it calibrated the measurement chain, but it does not retroactively change what was or was not established at H1.41.',
    )}</span>
  </div>

  <nav class="paper-nav" aria-label={t('报告目录', 'Report contents')}>
    {navItems.map((item) => <a href={item.href}>{item.label}</a>)}
  </nav>
</header>

<style>
  .results-hero{max-width:1160px;margin:0 auto;padding:36px 24px 12px;color:var(--color-text)}
  .eyebrow{margin:0 0 18px;color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:.75rem;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:.14em}
  .results-hero h1{margin:0;max-width:940px;font-size:clamp(2.35rem,5vw,4.35rem);line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-.05em}
  .lede{max-width:800px;margin:22px 0 0;color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.75}
  .abstract-box{max-width:960px;margin-top:30px;border-block:2px solid var(--color-text)}
  .abstract-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:150px minmax(0,1fr);gap:20px;padding:16px 0}
  .abstract-row+.abstract-row{border-top:1px solid var(--color-border)}
  .abstract-label{font-size:.74rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.04em;line-height:1.7}
  .abstract-label.established{color:var(--color-accent)}
  .abstract-label.bottleneck{color:var(--color-text-muted)}
  .abstract-row p{margin:0;max-width:78ch;font-size:.94rem;line-height:1.78}
  .cutoff-note{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:baseline;flex-wrap:wrap;max-width:960px;margin-top:20px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);font-size:.82rem}
  .cutoff-note strong{color:var(--color-accent)}
  .cutoff-note span{color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.6}
  .paper-nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.45rem 1.3rem;max-width:960px;margin-top:22px;padding:1rem 0;border-block:1px solid var(--color-border)}
  .paper-nav a{color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:.78rem;font-weight:720;text-decoration:none;text-underline-offset:.2em}
  .paper-nav a:hover,.paper-nav a:focus-visible{color:var(--color-text);text-decoration:underline}
  @media(max-width:720px){
    .results-hero{padding:24px 18px 8px}
    .abstract-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:6px}
  }
</style>
